  "intro": {
    "title": "Der erste März",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Up to 19 you add -te to the number (vier → vierte), from 20 you add -ste (zwanzig → zwanzigste). Erste, dritte, siebte and achte are the odd ones out.",
      "In writing, an ordinal is just the number with a point: der 3. Mai reads 'der dritte Mai'. Dates follow day, month, year, and you can even say the month as a number: der dritte Fünfte."
    ]
  },
